        {"path": "crates/c3/src/telemetry/classes.rs", "line": 922},
        {"path": "crates/c3/src/telemetry/event.rs", "line": 58}
      ],
      "claim": "The client-side closer rebuilds every event from a fixed key set and discards any event_type other than consultation|rating (close_event returns None). A new worker event, and new fields such as effort on existing events, are silently dropped on old or un-updated code paths unless the closer is extended in the same release with additive semantics (absent new fields must still close).",
